    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1631">

                <pb facs="1293" n="1283" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg1283"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">102.22/8–2549: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >McConaughy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-08-25T13:00:00+08:00">August 25, 1949—1
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 25—3:49 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3445. ReConGentel 3333, 19th, repeated Nanking 1798. Mediator could not or would
                    not see Thomas. Suggested letter outlining facts which submitted same day and
                    receipt taken but no reaction yet.</p>
                <p>Meantime 13 Sikhs increasingly insistent, even threatening. Feel that settlement
                    smaller issue which has more valid basis might further weaken case larger
                    group.</p>
                <p>Since Sikh delegation returning Monday<anchor n="53" xml:id="d1631-f1"/> for
                    “answer”, request immediate telegraphic approval funds requested reftel.</p>
                <p>Sent Department; repeated Nanking 1836.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McConaughy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1631-f1" n="53" xml:id="d1631-f1-content">
